                    {
                        "sense_id": "79a8f5c9-585d-3a78-ae9c-10e277fafd4d",
                        "entry_id": "15d6ea83-a39d-394f-b514-7d3fed028d3f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "midge (a kind of gnat or gnatlike fly)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5dbd498d-9b0f-45a3-ab33-9805017a95cb",
                                "sense_id": "79a8f5c9-585d-3a78-ae9c-10e277fafd4d",
                                "text": "Ла́сточки лета́ли высоко́; ве́тер совсе́м за́мер; запозда́лые пчё́лы лени́во и сонли́во жужжа́ли в цвета́х сире́ни; мо́шки толкли́сь столбо́м над одино́кою, далеко́ протя́нутою ве́ткою.",
                                "translation": "The swallows flew high; the wind had quite died down, some late bees hummed lazily among the lilac blossoms, a swarm of midges hung like a cloud over a solitary branch which stood out against the sky.",
                                "english": "The swallows flew high; the wind had quite died down, some late bees hummed lazily among the lilac blossoms, a swarm of midges hung like a cloud over a solitary branch which stood out against the sky."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
